  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "annot-2a2",
   "x": 70,
   "y": 2637.5,
   "width": 900,
   "height": 157.5,
   "text": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-24 (Dispatch hydration, 2A-S2): the artifact-backend delivery rail hydrates\nemail-source listeners. NEW integrations/event-sources/email-hydrate.ts exports the FROZEN\nEmailInput envelope + Graph/Gmail read_email normalizers (read-failure => THROW => queue retries;\nNEVER a silent preview body). NEW integrations/event-sources/dispatch-input.ts is the deps-injected\nartifact-backend input builder (email => EmailInput; else the unchanged generic { event, trigger }).\nWired ONLY in server.ts: the invokeArtifactBackend delivery target calls read_email via\ncallPlatformIntegration bound to the trigger's org (OAuth in core; the artifact never touches Graph).\nevents/delivery.ts keeps the target routing + retry/dead semantics. Consumed by the BSM ERP onEmail\nbackend (2B-S5/S6) - EmailInput is frozen.",
   "originalText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-24 (Dispatch hydration, 2A-S2): the artifact-backend delivery rail hydrates\nemail-source listeners. NEW integrations/event-sources/email-hydrate.ts exports the FROZEN\nEmailInput envelope + Graph/Gmail read_email normalizers (read-failure => THROW => queue retries;\nNEVER a silent preview body). NEW integrations/event-sources/dispatch-input.ts is the deps-injected\nartifact-backend input builder (email => EmailInput; else the unchanged generic { event, trigger }).\nWired ONLY in server.ts: the invokeArtifactBackend delivery target calls read_email via\ncallPlatformIntegration bound to the trigger's org (OAuth in core; the artifact never touches Graph).\nevents/delivery.ts keeps the target routing + retry/dead semantics. Consumed by the BSM ERP onEmail\nbackend (2B-S5/S6) - EmailInput is frozen.",
   "rawText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-24 (Dispatch hydration, 2A-S2): the artifact-backend delivery rail hydrates\nemail-source listeners. NEW integrations/event-sources/email-hydrate.ts exports the FROZEN\nEmailInput envelope + Graph/Gmail read_email normalizers (read-failure => THROW => queue retries;\nNEVER a silent preview body). NEW integrations/event-sources/dispatch-input.ts is the deps-injected\nartifact-backend input builder (email => EmailInput; else the unchanged generic { event, trigger }).\nWired ONLY in server.ts: the invokeArtifactBackend delivery target calls read_email via\ncallPlatformIntegration bound to the trigger's org (OAuth in core; the artifact never touches Graph).\nevents/delivery.ts keeps the target routing + retry/dead semantics. Consumed by the BSM ERP onEmail\nbackend (2B-S5/S6) - EmailInput is frozen.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
