  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "annot-docx-2c-s4-20260724",
   "x": 70,
   "y": 2820,
   "width": 900,
   "height": 157.5,
   "text": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-24 (App DOCX served-app plane, 2C-S4): apps/ gains app-docx.ts - the served\ndocument-base app's REST window onto its linked Word doc. NEW apps/app-docx.ts router (GET\n/api/app-docx/status|projection|current, POST /api/app-docx/clean|edits) mounted at '/' in\nserver.ts AFTER the global JSON parser. Admission is app-files.ts admitApp VERBATIM incl. the\nowner-activation gate (Amendment 2: 403 ACCOUNT_DISABLED / 402 BILLING_LOCKED, fail-closed).\nThe document-source fns (getStatus/getProjection/getCurrent/getClean/applyReview over the 2C-S1\ndocx-redline engine) are the INJECTED seam wired ONLY at the composition root; error taxonomy is\nproperty-mapped (NoDocumentSourceError -> 404, RedlineBatchError -> 422), so the router imports no\nservice singleton. shared/served-app.ts gains the appDocx* descriptors + zod (schema-coverage COVERED).",
   "originalText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-24 (App DOCX served-app plane, 2C-S4): apps/ gains app-docx.ts - the served\ndocument-base app's REST window onto its linked Word doc. NEW apps/app-docx.ts router (GET\n/api/app-docx/status|projection|current, POST /api/app-docx/clean|edits) mounted at '/' in\nserver.ts AFTER the global JSON parser. Admission is app-files.ts admitApp VERBATIM incl. the\nowner-activation gate (Amendment 2: 403 ACCOUNT_DISABLED / 402 BILLING_LOCKED, fail-closed).\nThe document-source fns (getStatus/getProjection/getCurrent/getClean/applyReview over the 2C-S1\ndocx-redline engine) are the INJECTED seam wired ONLY at the composition root; error taxonomy is\nproperty-mapped (NoDocumentSourceError -> 404, RedlineBatchError -> 422), so the router imports no\nservice singleton. shared/served-app.ts gains the appDocx* descriptors + zod (schema-coverage COVERED).",
   "rawText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-24 (App DOCX served-app plane, 2C-S4): apps/ gains app-docx.ts - the served\ndocument-base app's REST window onto its linked Word doc. NEW apps/app-docx.ts router (GET\n/api/app-docx/status|projection|current, POST /api/app-docx/clean|edits) mounted at '/' in\nserver.ts AFTER the global JSON parser. Admission is app-files.ts admitApp VERBATIM incl. the\nowner-activation gate (Amendment 2: 403 ACCOUNT_DISABLED / 402 BILLING_LOCKED, fail-closed).\nThe document-source fns (getStatus/getProjection/getCurrent/getClean/applyReview over the 2C-S1\ndocx-redline engine) are the INJECTED seam wired ONLY at the composition root; error taxonomy is\nproperty-mapped (NoDocumentSourceError -> 404, RedlineBatchError -> 422), so the router imports no\nservice singleton. shared/served-app.ts gains the appDocx* descriptors + zod (schema-coverage COVERED).",
